# Witness: a route table declaring a ninth review area

The eight are a fixed enumeration, and EXACTLY the eight is the claim - not at least the eight.
Without the no-extras half the enumeration stops being self-checking against the document, and
a ninth area could be introduced in the route a reviewer follows while nothing named it.

